    "text": "Student life at IIT (BHU) Varanasi runs through the Gymkhana, which spreads activities across five councils covering culture, sports, science and technology, film and media, and social service. Each session builds toward flagship events — the techno-management fest Technex, the socio-cultural fest Kashiyatra, and the sports meet Spardha — alongside a steady calendar of smaller club-run workshops, talks and competitions.",
